msgid "Trusted Access"
msgstr "Trusted 免密"

msgid "Devices in the whitelist can open the LuCI web page, the web terminal, and SSH without a password."
msgstr "白名单中的设备可以免密开启 LuCI 管理页面、Web 终端和 SSH。"

msgid "You can add one IP address (10.3.2.5) or one subnet (10.3.2.0/24). Only IPv4 is supported. The router always trusts 127.0.0.1."
msgstr "您可添加一个 IP 地址（10.3.2.5）或一个网段（10.3.2.0/24）。仅支持 IPv4。路由器始终信任 127.0.0.1。"

msgid "The whitelist must contain at least one address. The router does not accept an empty whitelist."
msgstr "白名单必须至少包含一个地址。路由器不接受空的白名单。"

msgid "Whitelist"
msgstr "白名单"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "IP address"
msgstr "IP 地址"

msgid "Enter an IP address or a subnet that you trust. Example: 10.3.2.5 or 10.3.2.0/24."
msgstr "请输入您信任的 IP 地址或网段。示例：10.3.2.5 或 10.3.2.0/24。"

msgid "Add the address that your device uses now."
msgstr "请添加您的设备当前使用的地址。"

msgid "Web terminal without a password"
msgstr "Web 终端免密"

msgid "If you enable this option, whitelisted devices can log in to the web terminal without a password."
msgstr "如果您启用此选项，白名单设备将可以免密登录 Web 终端。"

msgid "This option applies to whitelisted devices only. Devices outside the whitelist can still log in to the web terminal with a user name and a password."
msgstr "此选项只作用于白名单内的设备。白名单外的设备仍可通过用户名和密码登录 Web 终端。"

msgid "SSH without a password"
msgstr "SSH 免密"

msgid "If you enable this option, a whitelisted device runs ssh trusted@router-address and reaches a root shell without a login."
msgstr "如果您启用此选项，白名单设备通过执行 ssh trusted@路由器地址 即进入 root shell，而无需登录。"

msgid "This option applies to whitelisted devices only. Devices outside the whitelist can still log in on port 22 with a password or a key."
msgstr "此选项只作用于白名单内的设备。白名单外的设备仍可在 22 端口用密码或密钥登录。"

msgid "Block devices that are not in the whitelist"
msgstr "禁止白名单外设备登录"

msgid "If you enable this option, the router blocks devices outside the whitelist from the LuCI web page and the web terminal."
msgstr "如果您启用此选项，白名单外的设备将会被阻止访问 LuCI 管理页面和 Web 终端。"

msgid "This option is independent of the two options above. It does not change how whitelisted devices get in without a password."
msgstr "此选项独立于上面两个选项。它不改变白名单设备免密进入的方式。"

msgid "Caution: the whitelist must contain your own address. If it does not, you cannot open this page after you save the configuration."
msgstr "注意：白名单必须包含您自己的地址。否则保存配置后您将无法打开此页面。"

msgid "Before you enable this option, make sure that you know the root password. Also make sure that you have a valid SSH key. If the router blocks you, log in with SSH and run trusted deny off. If SSH is not available, use the serial console."
msgstr "启用此选项之前，请确认您知道 root 密码，并备有可用的 SSH 密钥。若被挡住，请用 SSH 登录并执行 trusted deny off。若 SSH 不可用，请使用串口控制台。"

msgid "Enter an IPv4 address or a subnet. Example: 10.3.2.5 or 10.3.2.0/24."
msgstr "请输入 IPv4 地址或网段。示例：10.3.2.5 或 10.3.2.0/24。"

msgid "Remove the leading zero from each part. Example: type 10.3.2.8, not 10.3.2.08."
msgstr "请去掉每一段的前导零。示例：填 10.3.2.8，不要填 10.3.2.08。"

msgid "Each part must be a number from 0 to 255."
msgstr "每一段必须是 0 到 255 的数字。"

msgid "The subnet prefix must be a number from 0 to 32."
msgstr "网段前缀必须是 0 到 32 的数字。"

msgid "The whitelist is empty. Add your own address in \"IP address\" first. Then enable this option. If you save now, the firewall blocks your device and you cannot open this page."
msgstr "白名单为空。请先在「IP 地址」中加入您自己的地址，再启用此选项。若现在保存，防火墙会挡住您的设备，您将无法打开此页面。"
